::SQL Subqueries::
In SQL a subquery is a query wrapped in a query. {T}

::SQL Subqueries::
Choose the different types of Subqueries.
{
    =Inline view, Inner Query, Nested Query
    ~Nested Query, Super Query, Set Query
    ~Union Query, Join Query, Inline View
    ~None of these
}

::SQL Subqueries::
While executing a query, the outer query is executed before a nested query. {
    ~ True
    = False
}

::SQL Subqueries::
Subqueries can produce the same results as a join. {T}

::SQL Subqueries::
Subqueries are more performant than joins. {
    ~ True
    = False
}
